  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Experience running nirvana with the ASICS GEL-1130. Spanning decades of design evolution, these innovation-led sneakers enhance your high-impact strides while paying homage to the ninth iteration of the GEL-1000 series. Powered by suede overlays and breathable mesh underlays, these reimagined silhouettes are true masterpieces that make each run a celebration of your passion for brilliance.</p> <p>The repurposed traditional materials with synthetic leather paneling evolve these shoes for a more modern aesthetic. Plus, the GEL technology in the heel lets you log those long hours of runs with excellent shock absorption and cushioning. Your secret to comfort-fueled running victories – the ASICS GEL-1130 lets you unlock your true potential. </p> <ul> <li>Upper inspired by compositional elements of GEL-KAYANO 14 preserves the TRUSSTIC support system and adds stability.</li> <li>Dyed sockliner helps reduce overall water usage by approx. 33% and carbon emissions by approx. 45% and offers sustainable comfort.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Heritage running DNA meets street-ready style in the ASICS GEL-1130, a retro-inspired silhouette rooted in the GEL-1000 series lineage that delivers cloud-like comfort whether you're logging miles or putting together a fresh everyday look. The breathable mesh upper pairs with suede and synthetic leather overlays for a layered build that holds its own across long days, while heel GEL technology cushions every stride with proven shock absorption. Built with a TRUSSTIC support system borrowed from the GEL-KAYANO 14 and a sustainably dyed sockliner, the GEL-1130 earns its place as a go-to for comfort and style in equal measure.</p> <ul> <li>Breathable mesh upper with suede and synthetic leather overlays for structure and airflow</li> <li>Heel GEL technology delivers targeted shock absorption and underfoot cushioning</li> <li>Upper inspired by the GEL-KAYANO 14 with TRUSSTIC support system for added stability</li> <li>Dyed sockliner reduces water usage by approx. 33% and carbon emissions by approx. 45%</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>The GEL-1130 fits true to size for most wearers. For the best fit, we recommend ordering your standard size. Those between sizes or with a wider foot may find going up a half size gives a more comfortable feel.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Perfect for wearers who want all-day comfort and retro running style across casual outings, long shifts, and everyday wear.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p> <p>Heel GEL cushioning absorbs impact across a variety of surfaces, while the structured midsole delivers stable, comfortable strides mile after mile. The GEL-1130's layered sole construction keeps underfoot feel consistently smooth and plush, from the sidewalk to the track.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Reviewers consistently report the GEL-1130 feels comfortable right out of the box, with wearers noting the shoes continue to look and feel fresh even after weeks of regular use, a strong reflection of ASICS' build quality at this price point.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-1130 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Green/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A609-106</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 9</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 44.2</td><